sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CO as Coordinator
    participant R as Replica
    participant CL as Commit log (disk)
    participant M as Memtable
    CO->>R: Mutation
    alt Periodic sync
      R->>CL: Append mutation
      R-->>CO: ACK before disk sync
      Note over CL: Sync every commitlog_sync_period_in_ms
    else Batch sync
      R->>CL: Append mutation
      Note over R,CL: Wait up to the batch window
      R->>CL: Sync to disk
      R-->>CO: ACK after sync
    end
    R->>M: Apply mutation
